<mxCell id="m96" value="V was fitted to T as it was after stage 1. Stage 3 then changed T, at a low learning rate (10⁻⁵) for 270 steps, and V was not refitted. The footprint tests in section 9 use the final model, so any mismatch is already in their scores." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FEF3C7;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=1.2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1E293B;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="580" y="832" width="470" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
